Day 7 : Challenges in ML

1.	Data Collection
	1. Fetch from API
	2. Web Scraping

2. Insufficient Data / Labelled Data
	Unneccessary effictiveness : The algorithm which is not good can perform good if we train it for large variation of data rather than the best algo on less data.

3. Non Representative Data
	Sampling Noise / Sampling Bias : Wrong Model fitting if we used less data for training and if more data is added then it might happen that the model shoul fit differently to get predictions correct.


4. Poor Quality Data
	
5. Irrelevant Features
	Feature Engineering( Splitting or Combining features )

6. Overfitting
	Memorization
	Bad result on testing only

7. Underfitting
 	Bad result on training and testing

8. Software Integration

9. Offline Learning

10. Cost Involved

